[[King Khimaar]] was a king of the then-human [[Margonite]]s when they ventured into the [[Crystal Desert]] in search of [[Ascension]]. He and many of his people died at [[Thirsty River]]. Protecting him and making sure his spirit is not driven away by the [[Forgotten]] is the bonus objective of said mission.

